      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "Impostors were created because fallbacks were always different from the actual avatar, and pretty much no one uploaded a custom fallback. I feel like this would fall into the same pit.\n\nYou have avatars that look, act, work and feel different, but now it's up to six versions instead of just two.\n\nAnd should each of them have their own impostor? You couldn't just use the very poor one, because it would by design look and be different from the other versions.",
      "viewerReactions": null,
      "voteID": null
    },
