      "spam": false,
      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "@{62e7bbe6e353fc44bda01012|full_name} It could be an option. We can keep the same workflow of having impostors + very poor versions, but people can also have the option to allow the optimized version.\n\nImpostors are already out of sync, especially so if someone uses an existing fallback. To me, \"optimized\" versions are a middle ground between Impostors and full avatars. It allows a little more immersion than just seeing impostors everywhere.",
      "viewerReactions": null,
      "voteID": null
    }
